{"id":"n85340-1-11","stage":5,"title":"항구 · 港口","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85340-1-11-1","ko":"항구에 사람들이 굉장히 많구나.","zh":"港口里的人真多啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"항구에","meaning":"港口","explanation":"항구：港口；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"항구","audio":"/audio/9b441d945d4825eb5a2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85340","senseId":"1","lemma":"항구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항구에","audio":"/audio/969dc9466e9df6da821a.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常","explanation":"굉장히：非常","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"1","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}},{"text":"많구나.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많구나","audio":"/audio/aa53bcae8325514f6f9e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9b441d945d4825eb","term":"항구","zh":"港口","audio":"/audio/9b441d945d4825eb5a2c.mp3","entryId":"85340","definition":"建设在江边或海边的设施，用于出入船舶。","pronunciation":["항ː구"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5ffdea7285118469","term":"굉장히","zh":"非常","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3","entryId":"30882","definition":"很大、很优秀地。","pronunciation":["굉장히","궹